.TH QUIPU-FLUENT-APPEND 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-fluent\-append \- Append a JSON observation through the native fluent writer
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu fluent append\fR [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIrequest.json\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Append a JSON observation through the native fluent writer
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
HTTP(S) server origin without credentials, query or path
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIrequest.json\fR>

